// The Last Hope — realistic enemy perception and procedural roaming.
// GZDoom's A_Wander picks movement directions and respects map collision;
// periodic A_LookEx checks make every patrol route emergent from the level geometry.
// No additional health, damage, speed, reaction bonuses or attack cadence are added.
//
// Senses: front-facing ~100 degree field of view, 1024 map-unit sight range,
// and 512-unit sound response. Actors chase normally after detecting a threat,
// but do not re-acquire targets with 360-degree awareness.
// TLHRealisticAIHandler (ZScript) gives up after a short period without sight.

ACTOR TLH_AI_DoomImp : DoomImp replaces DoomImp
{
    // No QUICKTORETALIATE, LOOKALLAROUND or FASTCHASE.
    States
    {
    Spawn:
        TROO A 8 A_LookEx(0, 0, 1024, 512, 100, "See")
        TROO A 4 A_Wander
        TROO B 4 A_Wander
        TROO C 4 A_LookEx(0, 0, 1024, 512, 100, "See")
        TROO D 4 A_Wander
        Loop

    See:
        TROO AABBCCDD 3 A_Chase("Melee", "Missile", CHF_DONTLOOKALLAROUND)
        Loop
    }
}

